t(24, 60, """… in the world of 1448 AH the matter never differs, not even by a mustard seed's weight, from the time of 1 AH! All the battles of truth without money, if they are besieged, strangled and squeezed .. stop .. the battle stops .. and after money come international relations, when they are cut off completely under a world that has become very intertwined.

Do not think it bad, for the battle stopping is easier than its death, and not every stop means death! Those people are preparing and getting ready "to receive the future", because it is 100% different from what they used to say for decades! They were saturated for decades with the idea that they alone are the people of liberation without the Ummah, and the idea that they are the spearhead who start the battle and then the Ummah enters it. Although I agree with that partly and relatively, I do not agree in the very way they conceive it, which goes to dimensions with exaggerations. I used to reply to that "on the forums" in the days of the forums and say "rather the whole Ummah" .. Allah the Exalted willed the presence of the Sunnah of mutual repelling, a push from Allah, so that the earth prepares its great readiness at all levels.""")

