t(28, 460, """One of our brothers from Syria among the people of the channel commented on a previous post about narrations in the weak part of the Book of Fitan of Shaykh Nu'aym, may Allah have mercy on him, saying that the narrations happened to our brothers the people of Syria. This clarification aims only to spread knowledge and is never meant as a rebuttal of our noble brother.

In that post came narrations, which are:

"Tribes of the Arabs will surely join the Romans in their entirety." I said: What is their entirety? He said: "With their shepherds and their dogs".

Explaining the narration and the meaning:
The form of the wording:
The report came in the form of telling of an unseen event that will happen at the end of time, when whole Arab tribes will take refuge in joining the lands of the Romans (fleeing to them).
Exaggeration in the flight: the phrase "with their shepherds and their dogs" (and in other narrations: "with their sheep and their dogs") is a figurative Arab expression meaning total departure and complete flight; that is, the tribe will move with everything it owns, even the simple things usually not paid attention to such as dogs and shepherds, so they leave nothing behind them.

"Tribes of the Arabs will surely join the Romans with their sheep and their dogs."

"How will you be when the fitnahs wrap around you, until tribes of the Arabs join the Romans in their entirety, leaving behind them neither a hobble nor a tick."

The hobble and the tick: another Arab expression indicating uprooting and total departure (the hobble is the camel's rope, and the tick is a small insect that clings to animals).

The sum of these narrations conveys tribes of the Arabs joining the Romans "in their entirety", because:

🔴 The Syrians, the greatest number of them entered Europe from Turkey, not from Syria, and when the huge human wave happened they were residing in Turkey as refugees, and the refugee owns nothing to take with him.
🔴 The individual cases, even if they number in thousands, of those who sold their homes, their cars and their women's gold to pay the smugglers and enter Europe, are fewer cases than the human wave of refugees who entered from Turkey and sold nothing.
🔴 The narrations say "tribes in their entirety", and this did not happen to the Syrians or to any Arabs who took refuge in Europe in any era. Where are the complete Syrian families who entered Europe and did not leave behind them in Syria a single relative? Likewise the complete Palestinian, Sudanese, Somali and Iraqi families who entered Europe and of whom no one remained in the original homeland? "In their entirety" means all of them, all their members.
🔴 The other meaning of the word "in their entirety" means with all, all that you own; that is, you will not leave behind even a straw but will take it with you, not sell it. There are many Syrians, Palestinians, Egyptians, people of the Maghreb countries, Sudanese, Yemenis and others who sold property to buy a visa or to travel by a certain route requiring payment of money, but the narrations did not say "they sell their property"; the narrations said "they take their property" of movable things that can be carried.
🔴 "How will you be when the fitnahs wrap around you, until tribes of the Arabs join the Romans in their entirety, leaving behind them neither a hobble nor a tick."
They do not leave behind them, and they do not sell. The sum of these narrations does not speak of houses at all, because they cannot be taken in a bag. The wordings are clear to the one who reflects, not to the one in a hurry. All these narrations speak of taking everything: gold, money, the yacht, the plane, loading furniture onto the yacht and the plane, every piece of clothing, every accessory, and everything that can be loaded and taken, even if very small and trivial in its size, not in its value.

Accordingly, none of these wordings even comes near the case of the Syrians and of the non-Syrian peoples who were cut off and reached the West.""")

h(28, 2400, """Not about Syria!""")

t(29, 600, """In life we build year after year. The building is inevitable, positive or negative; it is happening and there is no escape from it. Do not let a miserable childhood, a hard marriage, forced labour that wore out your youth, the hardship of your difficult journey in the abode of this world, a society that stuck its tongue out at you, your painful experiences, your thousands of stumbles, or the thousand disappointments in everyone you trusted .. do not let any of that make you lose the understanding you ought to have toward your children and toward everyone you are lawfully responsible for in your small or even wide circle.

You mean safety to your children, and if you are a danger to them, only Allah knows what will happen, but let me tell you that what will happen will never be good!

And for the others among people, the owners of noble, good souls, you are not their safety; they make their safety themselves between them and Allah the Exalted. You are their trust when the adviser and guide is scarce, so do not be the stab that breaks their backs, so that they fail and go astray with you!

However much you cried, and however long your groaning lasted, your commitment to remain a supporter of the truth and to remain a reformer on earth is a commitment that heals you and makes you well before others!

Because trust is commitment .. and because our vicegerency on earth as humans is commitment, and everyone committed to what he ought to do to reform people's world will remain alive on this earth, standing tall, and will never break. It is the best remedy for the reformer in a time when humanity has fallen collectively ill!""")

h(29, 1600, """Trust is not a word; trust is commitment!""")

t(29, 2215, """Beware of this one who has fallen into fitnah and his call. Abdulaziz al-Qahtani repeats every hour his claim that the Book of Allah is two books, and that each book has a meaning, and the devils show him in dreams a new grammar and morphology, so he wakes from sleep to seduce the ignorant with his words, and he presumes upon Allah the Most Great, holy are His names, that it was He who told him that, and that He praises his toying and tampering with the Book of Allah in a time of severe fitnahs where ignorance is extreme. As for his love of kingship, it is not people's business to follow him in it, nor should he be paid attention to, but what matters is that the people of Islam do not stay silent about his innovation in the Book of Allah and his tampering with it. His innovation would only pass among the ignorant because we are in a time of the intensity of these fitnahs, where ignorance is terrifying and frightening in quantity and quality! The Book of Allah the Exalted is a red line, and no soul was ever struck with passion and love for kingship but the heart became the seat of all fitnahs, absorbing them, and the devils of jinn and humans toy with it.""")

t(30, 70, """… everything in them is falsehood. O brothers, this is our state; we do not deny it or hide it, and there is not the slightest shame in it for us, and we are still now in need of that. O brothers, whoever trusts us, believes us and is able to do that, then is patient with us until we repay him, let him contact us … By Allah we have never let him down, and we could never neglect his right even if it were the amount of a mosquito. By Allah I am truthful in what I promised; I did not lie, nor claim, nor allege. You will see the current regimes fall like the leaves of trees until we become one Ummah, one army and one capital, which is Madinah al-Munawwarah, under the administration of one ruler. This will happen, and I am the one who will establish it and found it, by my hand. This will happen while you witness and watch. I have seen it from beginning to end, and we are now living in the middle of it. By Allah I am truthful; I did not lie, nor claim, nor allege. I will give you a sign of the truth of my words; it seems pure madness to us, but it is easy for Allah. By Allah I still do not know how it will happen, but it will definitely happen, and the sign is the following:
That you will see the first to submit to the truth in Yemen is Abu Jibril al-Sayyid Abdulmalik ibn Husayn Badr al-Din al-Houthi, or the one of his brothers who most resembles him.
And you will see the first to submit to the truth from the Gulf is Dr. Abu Abdulrahman Muhammad al-Arifi .... Now, by Allah, who will bring these two together, if not Allah the Exalted?? Between them is a repulsion that only Allah can remove. If I were a liar I would not choose something this impossible and this difficult, but I am truthful, and I do not know how they will come together; all I know is that it will definitely happen.""")

t(30, 880, """Fathers build the minds of their male children from the first moment of awareness, so in the boy's mind they build hatred of trades and contempt for craftsmanship, which is a thousand times better than the university profession. Then the boy grows up, and whenever his father passes a car mechanic, the father says to his child: Look how dirty his clothes are?! The father tried to make his son study seriously so he would not live the fate of the man with dirty clothes, so the world, generation after generation, teems with university graduates and bursts with holders of university degrees, and most sons find no work, and the same fathers say to their sons: If you had learned a trade you would be working now!

For these people, life is with pudding; they do not know how they made their children, on what they raised them, and how they founded in their minds ideas that took root. They set the child's entitlement very high: either I work as a doctor, an engineer, a pilot or an atomic scientist!

The child barely managed to finish a two-year institute because of many circumstances, some not his fault, or finished a university major considered a gateway to poverty and fatigue, and then he cannot adapt at all to the idea of learning a trade. Because some fathers understand nothing of matters of upbringing; they always have no calculations in it and no depth in grasping the effect of building the child's mind in a certain way. Then we find many of these fathers, when their children's bones harden and they sit on the pavements, describing them as failures, while they themselves are basically the biggest cause of their children's failure. But these are the results of upbringing with pudding .. an upbringing and raising unrelated to right guidance. The father's role and the mother's role is guidance, not feeding; dates and water in the house for the whole family are better than daily feasts while the child is raised the wrong way.

Note: in the future of people all this will not have an effect, Allah the Exalted willing, but the post is about my watching the case of a young man who appeared to me on YouTube.""")

h(30, 2000, """The mistakes of fathers when the child is born: “You are a doctor, and look how the construction worker toils?!”""")

